# TqSdk boundary

## Credential policy

- Allowed credential environment variables: TQ_USER and TQ_PASS
- Never hardcode usernames, passwords, tokens, or API keys
- Never write real credentials into source, tests, docs, or rules

## Test policy

- Default pytest must not require a real TqSdk account
- Default pytest must not perform live network requests
- Use monkeypatch, fake env, or stubs in unit tests

## Live API boundary

- Do not import or instantiate real TqApi unless an Issue explicitly allows it
- Keep connect behavior opt-in and offline-first in skeleton tasks

## Scope through TASK-007

- Skeleton and config wiring only
- Fake tests only
- No downloader implementation

